<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!IndividualApplication.PI_Name__c},<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Following the review of your application titled&nbsp;</font><b style="font-size: 12pt;">“</b><font face="arial"><b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b></font><b style="font-size: 12pt;">”</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">, the&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!IndividualApplication.Account}&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;has requested&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;">resubmission</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;with revisions. The feedback outlining the areas that need to be addressed is attached.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;">Please review the comments carefully and prepare the revised submission latest by {!IndividualApplication.Due_Date_for_Resubmission_WIN__c}.&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="isSelectedEnd"><b>COE Comments:</b><br>{!IndividualApplication.COE_Comments__c}<br><br></p><p><b>WIN Admin Comments:</b><br>{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="arial">Plea</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">se don’t hesitate to reach out to&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b>{!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c}</b></font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;on&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b>{!IndividualApplication.Coe_Email_Address__c}</b></font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;to assist with any questions or clarifications during the resubmission process.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your attention to this matter.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,<br><b>Wadhwani Foundation</b></p>]]></td>
</tr>
